    "detailed_description": "<strong>Awaken Lost Pilgrim</strong>, and fight through the Forsaken Lands, where there is only one constant...We Are All Going To Die. Discover the dark truth of the world you have been thrust into as you battle through this bullet hell.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Forsaken Lands</h2><br>A dark and mysterious world that has been destroyed and reborn 17 times before your arrival here. You are the Lost Pilgrim, a powerful being broken into many at the dawn of this cycle. Weak and alone, you must journey and discover this world and your purpose. Powerful forces work against you from on high and down in the depths of this Land.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2487420/extras/449b68f8db524df663c46b2775c864d2.poster.avif?t=1733506443\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2487420/extras/449b68f8db524df663c46b2775c864d2.webm?t=1733506443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2487420/extras/449b68f8db524df663c46b2775c864d2.mp4?t=1733506443\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Power to Change the World</h2><br>Within you lies the truth and sovereignty of this Land; harness it and make it yours. The Two and The 17 are Great Beings that control the world around you...but their power can be made yours through mastery and persistence.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2487420/extras/a8462c7204b605ec27d65d9c325eb3e6.poster.avif?t=1733506443\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2487420/extras/a8462c7204b605ec27d65d9c325eb3e6.webm?t=1733506443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2487420/extras/a8462c7204b605ec27d65d9c325eb3e6.mp4?t=1733506443\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Cast of New and Strange Characters</h2><br>You will find few allies in The Forsaken Lands, but a group of beings, both mystical and familiar, can provide aid on your long journey.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2487420/extras/caab1d13c6fda1f6f94fb0e1d57edeae.poster.avif?t=1733506443\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2487420/extras/caab1d13c6fda1f6f94fb0e1d57edeae.webm?t=1733506443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Just remember...there is one constant here, Lost Pilgrim.<br><br><strong>We Are All Going To Die.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2487420/extras/6bc51c2c7a78e92254316fd868361be2.poster.avif?t=1733506443\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2487420/extras/6bc51c2c7a78e92254316fd868361be2.webm?t=1733506443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2487420/extras/6bc51c2c7a78e92254316fd868361be2.mp4?t=1733506443\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Awaken Lost Pilgrim</strong>, and fight through the Forsaken Lands, where there is only one constant...We Are All Going To Die. Discover the dark truth of the world you have been thrust into as you battle through this bullet hell.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Forsaken Lands</h2><br>A dark and mysterious world that has been destroyed and reborn 17 times before your arrival here. You are the Lost Pilgrim, a powerful being broken into many at the dawn of this cycle. Weak and alone, you must journey and discover this world and your purpose. Powerful forces work against you from on high and down in the depths of this Land.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2487420/extras/449b68f8db524df663c46b2775c864d2.poster.avif?t=1733506443\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2487420/extras/449b68f8db524df663c46b2775c864d2.webm?t=1733506443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2487420/extras/449b68f8db524df663c46b2775c864d2.mp4?t=1733506443\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Power to Change the World</h2><br>Within you lies the truth and sovereignty of this Land; harness it and make it yours. The Two and The 17 are Great Beings that control the world around you...but their power can be made yours through mastery and persistence.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2487420/extras/a8462c7204b605ec27d65d9c325eb3e6.poster.avif?t=1733506443\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2487420/extras/a8462c7204b605ec27d65d9c325eb3e6.webm?t=1733506443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2487420/extras/a8462c7204b605ec27d65d9c325eb3e6.mp4?t=1733506443\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Cast of New and Strange Characters</h2><br>You will find few allies in The Forsaken Lands, but a group of beings, both mystical and familiar, can provide aid on your long journey.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2487420/extras/caab1d13c6fda1f6f94fb0e1d57edeae.poster.avif?t=1733506443\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2487420/extras/caab1d13c6fda1f6f94fb0e1d57edeae.webm?t=1733506443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Just remember...there is one constant here, Lost Pilgrim.<br><br><strong>We Are All Going To Die.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2487420/extras/6bc51c2c7a78e92254316fd868361be2.poster.avif?t=1733506443\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2487420/extras/6bc51c2c7a78e92254316fd868361be2.webm?t=1733506443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2487420/extras/6bc51c2c7a78e92254316fd868361be2.mp4?t=1733506443\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "short_description": "You Will Not Survive is an Action Roguelike that combines RPG Leveling, Dungeon Crawling, and Fast-Paced Bullet Hell Combat. Embrace death in this dark fantasy adventure as you try to discover your purpose and origins within The Forsaken Lands. Only you can decide the fate of this scarred world.",
